                <table summary="information table">
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      <div class="mp_text_box">
                       
                        CornCyc is comprehensive metabolic pathway 
                        resources developed using the Pathway Tools Software 
                        Suite in collaboration between MaizeGDB, the Plant 
                        Metabolic Network (PMN\) (CornCyc\). MaizeGDB curators performed literature-based 
                        manual annotation for both resources. MaizeCyc is a comparable tool that was once supported here, 
                        but no longer is. Comparisons between CornCyc and MaizeCyc can be found below.
                        <br><br>
                        While CornCyc and MaizeCyc are generated using the same 
                        Pathway Tools Software Suite to generate their 
                        respective data sets, they differ in the number of 
                        pathways, enzymes, and enzymatic reactions.  This is 
                        mainly due to their respective methods of assigning 
                        enzymatic function. You can find more information about 
                        both resources in the "Information and Tutorials"
                        section below. 
                      </div>
                    </td>
                    <td rowspan=15 align="center" valign="top">
                      <img src="/images/metabolic_pathway.png">
                    </td>
                  </tr>
